-- alt: ResourceFlowMode, KSP.Sim.ResourceFlowMode
---Flow mode governing how resources are distributed between parts in a vessel.
---@alias ResourceFlowModeInterop
---| "NULL" # Uninitialized or unset flow mode sentinel.
